# [MODULE DOC]
# Library for finding checksum mismatches in GPU buffer debug logs (generated by running with
# checksum tracing on thunks enabled). Defines identifier types, immutable records for buffer
# checksums, thunk metadata, a single thunk execution and the final report, plus helpers that
# parse log and metadata protocol buffers, group executions, and detect thunks whose outputs differ
# between executions that had identical input checksums. The report class is the public entry
# point (used by the check_thunk_output_consistency tool); the underscore functions are internal.
# No import-time side effects other than defining types.
